      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Listening to you and seeing the frustration in your words makes it deeply unfortunate that you've hit that point. Sometimes changes in perception can be overwhelming and can feel isolating. It might be helpful to speak to a mental health professional who can provide personalized support and strategies for navigating through these feelings. Remember that reaching out is a brave and important step to finding your path again.",
